07_1351545363214646_5506338495222860567_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qDLLYhAR-BQQ7kNvwGm37gT&_nc_oc=AdocUdELYWz5rlnEPPFsHIj65Rad62zhxBeRc0RYQ-3H1rSWoRogW8-raNZ7hPFBGkc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLwSMMmCYVd1RGa_8yAusUSCmyNmodeBkRQrYrGMJkV7g&oe=6AB53142"}, {"file_name": "ss5.png", "id": "1715729295759342", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499305050_1715729299092675_4690986203494255387_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rw5OvOcoVJAQ7kNvwFG2YJv&_nc_oc=AdqXb_8LIZfghlFMrV6DzRyg0v6IsFYk0YW9Fw4Mg1oZB14_DaH-4GbyepL7BUIJNLc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKLOYEaE08t1JF8Tt51PvByhFX6bx9va5FafdZIgvBDig&oe=6AB526BF"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Portrait.png", "id": "806605711863955", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823486_806605715197288_1898259061609879939_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dhbO7oq75T8Q7kNvwGfF-qI&_nc_oc=Adqakh0qsf62_TfVrC5Hk8lpdBO2nKu4yxA36okqaDscf0IMNVueniNFRca3eiiamjs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJY63MgKa3EmjO8AvCp5KdoZuaMZneCpdfhZkkq22M4fw&oe=6AB535B0"}, "display_name": "Afterlife: Dead Zone", "keywords": ["zombies", "shooter", "disparos", "zombis", "horror"], "long_description": "In Afterlife: Dead Zone, you play as a soldier trapped in the Dead Zones, isolated areas where help seems impossible. Humanity teeters on the brink of extinction: ancient alien civilizations have returned to assess our development and, deeming us a threat, unleash weapons of mass destruction that turn people into bloodthirsty monsters.\n\nExplore dark, devastated post-apocalyptic environments where hordes of zombies and mutated creatures can appear around every corner. Your mission is simple but deadly: shoot and avoid dying. While your weapons have infinite ammo, the variety and ferocity of enemies will demand strategy and quic